cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FIBEMATE
message: >-
  If you use FIBEMATE in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Tianhe
    family-names: Liu
    orcid: null
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Lennonhaha/fibemate'
url: 'https://fibemate.net'
abstract: >-
  FIBEMATE is a post-quantum cryptography full-stack engineering verification platform.
  It implements ML-KEM-768 (FIPS 203), SLH-DSA (FIPS 205), and Chinese national standards
  SM2/SM3/SM4, with TLS 1.3 hybrid key exchange (X25519MLKEM768), FPGA hardware acceleration,
  and formal verification via TLA+ and QROM proofs.
keywords:
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - ML-KEM-768
  - FIPS 203
  - TLS 1.3
  - hybrid key exchange
  - SM2
  - SM3
  - SM4
  - FPGA
  - TLA+
  - formal verification
license: GPL-3.0-only
version: 3.3-preview
date-released: '2026-07-17'
